.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:9:PR #1740 integrates the current #1704 implementation: authenticated O3/full-LTO production, fixture ownership and read-only test consumption, native source/catalog reuse, typed correspondence and deontic DAG work, native RDF 1.2 literal identity, source admission/TPTP integration, old-graph ownership removal, and broad duplicate-test extraction.
