.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:23:- Review current CodeRabbit findings and required CI on the post-merge follow-up PR before its final merge.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:37:Merged PR #1760 at `b1676af1a` restores one immutable source analysis for exact taxonomy reachability, fixed-head absence, and property-characteristic impossibility. Existing tests compare every certified family with full scratch/native retraction, including canonical `logic:` spellings, finite-union fallback, multiple worlds, and alternative proofs. Unclassified constructs continue through the complete native transaction; no bounded-corpus observation authorizes a broader rewrite.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:63:The active #1757 worktree now provisions the pinned ripgrep installer in both the primary `rust-prebuild` job and the `rust-archive` cache-miss fallback, with the workflow contract test requiring both placements. `make lint` passes; the focused synthetic nextest contract is compiling from a cold local cache.
