.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:77:Focused synthetic validation passes (2 tests, 7,146 skipped), and CodeRabbit's scanner-order finding was incorporated. The refreshed hosted run is the direct acceptance check for cross-job producer transfer.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:92:This is measured O3/full-LTO producer-build evidence, not a speedup claim. It confirms the optimized producer build/link surface is itself a major critical-path owner and does not saturate the four-core runner. The narrow producer surface remains required follow-on work in #1757; scheduler changes alone cannot remove this 18.5-minute pre-generation cost.
