.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:134:#1759 carries the completion-driven scheduler slice. Local focused checks pass, including the regression that proved the coordinator had consumed one configured worker slot; the implementation now uses in-place Rayon scope coordination and all configured workers remain available.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:136:The PR deliberately leaves full hosted validation here. The prior main run `35187835885` passed lint, producer-build, and rust-prebuild and admitted the optimized producer into both independent cold-generation jobs; those cold generations were still running when #1759 opened.
