.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:202:7. Reconcile every remaining #1704 child only against its own acceptance evidence, including #1748's complete program-aware admitted native run. Review and resolve current CodeRabbit findings and all required CI checks, then merge only through `ghprsq`.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/issue.md:223:The reason stage already defines three returned timing phases (`assemble-object-edb`, `construct-closure-and-artifacts`, and `assemble-reason-product`), but those records are unavailable when a bounded run terminates before stage completion. The active #1757 branch adds INFO-level live boundaries around those same phases so the next admitted optimized run identifies the exact long phase without changing outputs or cache identities. Formatting passes and the affected optimized crate lineage compiled; the final O3/full-LTO link was stopped by the bounded build deadline, so no completed instrumented producer or performance fix is claimed.
