.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/pr1802-source-publication.md:1:Production reasoning previously refused or stalled while building its termination certificates and class-model evidence. This integration combines the existing reasoning repairs with the authorized PurRDF Git-main API port, preserving typed failures, native RDF 1.2 statements, exact source/world identities and authenticated producer/test boundaries.
