.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/issue1757-current.json:168:      "body": "Follow-up validation correction: the warmed `cargo check --locked -p gmeow-logic` completed successfully in 3m11s. The deeper native-materialization telemetry compiles; the earlier five-minute timeout was dependency recompilation only and is superseded by this pass.\n",
