.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/issue1762-cli-services-current.txt:60:1. Migrate every production numeric preparation and execution failure return to `gmeow_errors::Result` with typed Diag kinds. A cloneable typed preparation payload may support cached diagnostic reconstruction, but never becomes a parallel function error type: `Diag` owns propagation at every failure-returning boundary. Each cached retrieval mints a fresh Diag and attaches the requesting rule. Preserve operation, operands, datatype, rule locus and original scalar detail. Validate with malformed literal, missing binding, arithmetic failure and repeatable cached-error cases; then commit with hooks, push, and post the validation/hash to #1762.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/issue1762-cli-services-current.txt:61:2. Define one evidence-preserving diagnostic-to-report conversion contract. Extend the serialized report diagnostic payload with grade, context and typed machine fields used by these surfaces; retain deterministic text and exit behavior. Migrate source discovery/read/parse, problem publication, digest, executable discovery/version and execution. Every process failure retains argv, executable/problem identity, available status/signal, timeout/truncation, and both streams' partial bytes/digests/counts. Bounded capture and child cleanup remain mandatory. Validate missing/unexecutable prover, failing/empty/truncated version, timeout/nonzero exit, partial stream failure and source failures; run shared-behavior integration review; commit with hooks, push, and post the validation/hash.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/issue1762-cli-services-current.txt:62:3. Migrate external artifact/model failure propagation to `gmeow_errors::Result`. Convert `ArtifactProtocolError` and `EvalError` into typed diagnostic payloads or non-error outcome classifications, with Diag owning every failure-returning boundary. Invalid, unsupported, structural-only and resource-limited outcomes remain distinct typed decisions; no caller infers them from prose. Preserve parser/model locus and original detail. Validate malformed/unsupported models and evaluation-budget exhaustion; run integration review; commit with hooks, push, and post the validation/hash.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/issue1762-cli-services-current.txt:63:4. Audit all named surfaces, dependent callers, local error enums and error tuples. Add report serialization/exit regressions and assert code, grade, typed evidence, retained causes and stable ordering. Run `make fmt`, `make lint`, `make nextest-synthetic NEXTEST_FILTER='package(gmeow-logic) | package(gmeow-cli)'`, then `make crate-check`; run one complete `make check` after all changes. Repair every in-scope failure. Run the deferral scan and verify the deficiency ledger before PR creation; commit any final test/audit unit with hooks, push, and post its evidence.
