.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/issue1762-cli-services-current.txt:66:Enhancement audit: adopted the medium/high-payoff transformation of one evidence-preserving Diag-to-report conversion contract across all named surfaces. Adopted reuse of DiagKind/source context/process receipts, machine-readable operation and artifact identities, and failure injection for partial capture/repeated cached failures. Declined a new diagnostic framework because the existing canonical substrate already supplies codes, grades, provenance and serialization targets; extending its projection is sufficient. Declined ontology changes because this issue migrates internal failure carriers and mints no semantic vocabulary. No requirement is deferred or stubbed.
