.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/issue1768-next-prover-current.txt:87:Distribution slice is implemented in #1771. The optimized one-file binary passed the acceptance with the complete checkout made unreadable: `gmeow prove` and embedded GMN loading both succeeded from a copied executable in a blind working directory. The source-first build, signed-release embedding, and stale native-codebook identity pin are included. Full canon admission remains explicitly blocked by #1770.
