.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1798-consolidation-comments.md:39:* **Bug Fixes**
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1798-consolidation-comments.md:40:  * Datalog rules now get a chance to complete relationships before witness-generating rules run, helping valid executions satisfy reverse restrictions without creating unnecessary witnesses.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1798-consolidation-comments.md:41:  * Witness-generating rules run after Datalog processing reaches a stable point. Ordinary property rules continue to use changes from the current round.
