.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:197:## Summary by CodeRabbit
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:198:
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:199:* **Reasoning Improvements**
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:200:  * Witness-generating rules now run after ordinary rule processing reaches a pause, allowing existing facts to prevent unnecessary witnesses.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:201:  * More programs can be certified for complete reasoning; unsupported cases provide clearer explanations and may still require a budget.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:202:  * Equivalent spellings of cardinality qualifiers are treated consistently, and cardinality conflicts are limited to affected individuals.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:203:  * `xsd:anyURI` is recognized as an unbounded datatype, with length restrictions measured on its whitespace-collapsed text.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:204:  * Data-property cardinality constraints now consistently use literal value ranges.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:205:
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:206:* **Diagnostics**
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:207:  * Inconclusive results and encoding failures provide more detail about what could not be processed.
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:208:
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:209:<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->
.stage/perf-logic-finish-merged-pipeline/raw/pr1802-current-comments.md:210:The changes add Datalog-first restricted-chase execution and restricted joint acyclicity certification. They also expand native admission analysis, refine definition-writer and cardinality checks, recognize `xsd:anyURI`, update result diagnostics and artifact tests, and revise selected ontology declarations.
