-19`: LGTM!\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 726-730, 763-763, 867-874, 929-931, 1318-1323, 1358-1359, 1375-1376, 1494-1494, 1579-1599, 1620-1627, 1657-1700, 1748-1756, 564-618\n\n<!-- cr-comment:v1:12fa2a05c7eef75d25ee103b -->\n\n---\n\n`1178-1188`: **\ud83c\udfaf Functional Correctness**\n\n**Keep reductions out of the restricted termination graph.**\n\nThe merge-base implementation already excluded reduction rules from `producer_admission`. Reductions execute once over complete groups, and their body reads are marked as completed dependencies. Stratification rejects any feedback cycle that includes such a dependency. Therefore a reduction can provide a finite seed to a later existential producer, but it cannot create an accepted recursive chase cycle that the restricted termination graph must model. The proposed `rja_exact: false` change is not required.\n\n<!-- cr-comment:v1:b7532818c3c27ada5af4b02f -->\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>crates/logic/src/physical/seminaive/joint/families.rs: 1</summary><blockquote>\n\n`149-149`: LGTM!\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 408-408\n\n<!-- cr-comment:v1:e08f774fbf44160f3a6ad1b6 -->\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>crates/logic/src/physical/seminaive/joint/tests.rs: 1</summary><blockquote>\n\n`7-7`: LGTM!\n\n<!-- cr-comment:v1:8aab89c41091e3b3833ccd63 -->\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>crates/logic/src/physical/chase.tests.rs: 1</summary><blockquote>\n\n`1378-1378`: LGTM!\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 1406-1406, 1731-1825\n\n<!-- cr-comment:v1:80fff919848b38b3e4d49cf6 -->\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>crates/logic/src/physical/seminaive/joint/input/admission.rs: 1</summary><blockquote>\n\n`74-74`: LGTM!\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 838-838\n\n<!-- cr-comment:v1:61d8551ac577c02159c9cbb4 -->\n\n</blockquote></details>\n<details>\n<summary>crates/logic/src/physical/seminaive/joint/input/tests.rs: 1</summary><blockquote>\n\n`881-881`: LGTM!\n\n\n\n\nAlso applies to: 1059-1059, 1090-